@startuml Sequencia_Favoritar_Refinado
autonumber
actor "Estudante" as User
boundary "Interface Web (SPA)" as UI
control "API REST (FastAPI)" as API
database "MongoDB" as DB

User -> UI: Clica em "Salvar / Favoritar"
activate UI

UI -> API: PATCH /api/estudantes/me/favoritos\n{ "oportunidadeId": "edital-123" }
activate API

API -> DB: updateOne({ _id: userId }, { $addToSet: { favoritos: "edital-123" } })
activate DB
DB --> API: { acknowledged: true, modifiedCount: 1 }
deactivate DB

API --> UI: HTTP 200 OK (Item favoritado)
deactivate API

UI --> User: Exibe feedback visual (Ícone marcado)
deactivate UI
@enduml